#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:2
msgid "Automation rules"
msgstr "自动化规则"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:4
msgid ""
"Automation rules allow project maintainers to automate actions on new "
"branches, tags, and pull requests in Git repositories. If you are familiar "
"with :term:`GitOps`, this might seem familiar. The goal of automation rules "
"is to be able to control versioning and builds through your Git repository "
"and avoid duplicating these efforts on Read the Docs."
msgstr ""
"自动化规则允许项目维护者自动化处理 Git 仓库中的新分支、标签和 Pull Request。如果你熟悉 :term:`GitOps` "
"，这可能看起来很眼熟。自动化规则的目标是让你能通过 Git 仓库控制版本管理和构建，避免在 Read the Docs 上重复这些工作。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:13
msgid ":doc:`/guides/automation-rules`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/automation-rules`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:14
msgid "A practical guide to managing automated versioning of your documentation."
msgstr "管理文档自动化版本控制的实用指南。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:16
msgid ":doc:`/versions`"
msgstr ":doc:`/versions`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:17
msgid "General explanation of how versioning works on Read the Docs"
msgstr "Read the Docs 上版本控制如何工作的总体说明"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:20
msgid "How automation rules work"
msgstr "自动化规则如何工作"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:22
msgid ""
"When a new tag or branch is pushed to your repository, or a pull request is "
"opened or updated, Read the Docs receives a webhook from your Git provider. "
"Read the Docs then creates (or updates) a *version* that matches your Git "
"*tag, branch, or pull request*."
msgstr ""
"当新标签或分支推送到你的仓库、或有 Pull Request 被打开或更新时，Read the Docs 会从 Git 服务商接收 Webhook。随后"
" Read the Docs 会创建（或更新）一个与你的 Git *标签、分支或 Pull Request* 匹配的* 版本* 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:27
msgid ""
"All enabled automation rules are evaluated for that version, in the order "
"they are listed. A rule has three groups of conditions, which are checked in"
" order:"
msgstr "所有已启用的自动化规则都会针对该版本按列出的顺序进行评估。每条规则有三组条件，按顺序检查："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:31
msgid ""
"The version **type** must be one of the version types selected in the rule "
"(tag, branch, or pull request)."
msgstr "版本**类型** 必须是规则中选定的版本类型之一（标签、分支或 Pull Request）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:32
msgid "The version **name** must match the version pattern in the rule."
msgstr "版本**名称** 必须匹配规则中的版本模式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:33
msgid ""
"If any **webhook filter** is configured, the data from the webhook event "
"(changed files, commit message, or pull request labels) must also match."
msgstr "如果配置了任何 **Webhook 过滤器** ，Webhook 事件中的数据（变更的文件、提交信息或 Pull Request 标签）也必须匹配。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:36
msgid ""
"If all the configured conditions match, the rule's **action** is performed "
"on the version."
msgstr "如果所有配置的条件都匹配，规则的**动作** 将在该版本上执行。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:40
msgid ""
"Versions can match multiple automation rules, and all matching version "
"actions will be performed on the version. For build actions, only the first "
"matching rule per version triggers a build, to avoid triggering multiple "
"builds for the same change."
msgstr "一个版本可以匹配多条自动化规则，所有匹配的版本动作都将在该版本上执行。对于构建动作，每个版本只触发第一条匹配规则的构建，以避免对同一变更触发多次构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:46
msgid "Matching the version type"
msgstr "匹配版本类型"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:48
msgid "Each rule applies to one or more version types:"
msgstr "每条规则适用于一种或多种版本类型："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:50
msgid "**Tag** — Git tags pushed to the repository."
msgstr "**标签** — 推送到仓库的 Git 标签。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:51
msgid "**Branch** — Git branches pushed to the repository."
msgstr "**分支** — 推送到仓库的 Git 分支。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:52
msgid "**Pull request** — pull/merge requests opened against the repository."
msgstr "**Pull Request** — 针对仓库打开的 Pull/Merge Request。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:54
msgid "You can select any combination of types in a single rule."
msgstr "你可以在一条规则中选择任意类型组合。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:57
msgid "Matching the version name"
msgstr "匹配版本名称"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:59
msgid ""
"We have a couple predefined ways to match against the name of versions that "
"are created, and you can also define your own."
msgstr "我们提供了几种预定义方式来匹配新建版本的名称，你也可以自定义。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:63
msgid "Predefined matches"
msgstr "预定义匹配"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:65
msgid "Automation rules support two predefined version name matches:"
msgstr "自动化规则支持两种预定义的版本名称匹配："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:67
msgid "**Any version**: All new versions will match the rule."
msgstr "**任意版本** ：所有新版本都匹配该规则。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:68
msgid ""
"**SemVer versions**: All new versions that follow `semantic versioning "
"<https://semver.org/>`__ (with or without a ``v`` prefix) will match the "
"rule."
msgstr ""
"**SemVer 版本** ：所有遵循 `semantic versioning <https://semver.org/>`__ （带或不带 "
"``v`` 前缀）的新版本都匹配该规则。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:72
msgid "Custom matches"
msgstr "自定义匹配"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:74
msgid ""
"If none of the above predefined matches meet your use case, you can use a "
"**Custom match**."
msgstr "如果上述预定义匹配都不满足你的需求，可以使用**自定义匹配** 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:77
msgid ""
"The custom match should be a valid `Python regular expression "
"<https://docs.python.org/3/library/re.html>`__. Each new version's name will"
" be tested against this regular expression."
msgstr ""
"自定义匹配应为有效的 `Python 正则表达式 <https://docs.python.org/3/library/re.html>`__ "
"。每个新版本的名称都会针对此正则表达式进行测试。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:81
msgid "Webhook filters"
msgstr "Webhook 过滤器"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:83
msgid ""
"In addition to matching the version, a rule can filter on the contents of "
"the webhook event that triggered it. Webhook filters are useful to **avoid "
"running an action when nothing relevant has changed**, for example to skip "
"builds when only non-documentation files were modified, or when the commit "
"message indicates the change should be ignored."
msgstr ""
"除了匹配版本，规则还可以根据触发它的 Webhook 事件内容进行过滤。Webhook 过滤器有助于**避免在无相关变更时运行动作** "
"，例如当仅修改了非文档文件、或提交信息表明应忽略该变更时跳过构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:89
msgid "The following filters are available:"
msgstr "可用的过滤器如下："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:91
msgid "Changed files"
msgstr "变更的文件"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:92
msgid ""
"Match against the list of files modified, added, or deleted in the push or "
"pull request. Patterns can include one or more of the following special "
"characters:"
msgstr "匹配推送或 Pull Request 中被修改、添加或删除的文件列表。模式可包含以下一个或多个特殊字符："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:95
msgid "``*`` matches everything, including slashes."
msgstr "``*`` 匹配所有内容，包括斜杠。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:96
msgid "``?`` matches any single character."
msgstr "``?`` 匹配任意单个字符。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:97
msgid "``[seq]`` matches any character in ``seq``."
msgstr "``[seq]`` 匹配 ``seq`` 中的任意字符。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:99
msgid ""
"Example patterns: - ``docs/*`` matches any file under the ``docs/`` "
"directory. - ``*.md`` matches any Markdown file. - ``.readthedocs.yaml`` "
"matches the configuration file in the root of the repository."
msgstr ""
"示例模式：- ``docs/*`` 匹配 ``docs/`` 目录下的任意文件。- ``*.md`` 匹配任意 Markdown 文件。- "
"``.readthedocs.yaml`` 匹配仓库根目录下的配置文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:104
msgid ""
"You can specify multiple patterns, one per line. The filter matches if "
"**any** of the changed files matches **any** pattern."
msgstr "你可以指定多个模式，每行一个。如果**任意** 变更文件匹配** 任意** 模式，过滤器即匹配。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:107
msgid "Commit message"
msgstr "提交信息"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:108
msgid ""
"Match against the commit message of the push event, or the head commit of "
"the pull request, using a regular expression."
msgstr "使用正则表达式匹配推送事件的提交信息，或 Pull Request 的头部提交信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:112
msgid "Pull request labels"
msgstr "Pull Request 标签"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:113
msgid ""
"Match against the labels of the pull request, using a regular expression. "
"This filter is only relevant for pull request events."
msgstr "使用正则表达式匹配 Pull Request 的标签。此过滤器仅与 Pull Request 事件相关。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:117
msgid ""
"When more than one filter is configured, **all** of them must match for the "
"rule to fire."
msgstr "配置多个过滤器时，**所有** 过滤器都必须匹配规则才会触发。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:121
msgid ""
"Webhook filters are only available for projects connected through the "
":doc:`GitHub App integration </reference/git-integration>`. Rules that don't"
" use webhook filters keep working with every Git provider."
msgstr ""
"Webhook 过滤器仅对通过 :doc:`GitHub App 集成 </reference/git-integration>` "
"连接的项目可用。不使用 Webhook 过滤器的规则仍可在所有 Git 服务商上工作。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:127
msgid ""
"Regular expressions are evaluated using the Python `re "
"<https://docs.python.org/3/library/re.html>`__ module."
msgstr "正则表达式使用 Python `re <https://docs.python.org/3/library/re.html>`__ 模块进行求值。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:131
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "动作"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:133
msgid ""
"When an automation rule matches, the specified action is performed on the "
"version. Actions are split into two groups: actions that operate on the "
"version itself, and actions that trigger a build."
msgstr "当自动化规则匹配时，指定的动作会在该版本上执行。动作分为两组：作用于版本本身的动作，以及触发构建的动作。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:139
msgid "Version actions"
msgstr "版本动作"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:141
msgid "Activate version"
msgstr "激活版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:142
msgid "Activates and builds the version."
msgstr "激活并构建该版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:144
msgid "Hide version"
msgstr "隐藏版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:145
msgid ""
"Hides the version. If the version is not active, activates it and builds the"
" version. See :ref:`versions:Version states`."
msgstr "隐藏该版本。如果版本未激活，则激活并构建它。请参阅 :ref:`versions:Version states` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:148
msgid "Make version public"
msgstr "设为公开版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:149
msgid ""
"Sets the version's privacy level to public. See :ref:`versions:Version "
"states`."
msgstr "将版本的隐私级别设为公开。请参阅 :ref:`versions:Version states` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:152
msgid "Make version private"
msgstr "设为私有版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:153
msgid ""
"Sets the version's privacy level to private. See :ref:`versions:Version "
"states`."
msgstr "将版本的隐私级别设为私有。请参阅 :ref:`versions:Version states` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:156
msgid "Set version as default"
msgstr "设为默认版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:157
msgid ""
"Sets the version as the :term:`default version`. It also activates and "
"builds the version. See :ref:`root_url_redirect`."
msgstr "将版本设为 :term:`default version` 。同时也会激活并构建该版本。请参阅 :ref:`root_url_redirect` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:161
msgid "Delete version"
msgstr "删除版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:162
msgid ""
"When a branch or tag is deleted from your repository, Read the Docs will "
"delete it *only if isn't active*. This action allows you to delete *active* "
"versions when a branch or tag is deleted from your repository."
msgstr "当分支或标签从仓库删除时，Read the Docs *仅在版本非活跃* 时删除它。此动作允许在分支或标签从仓库删除时删除* 活跃* 版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:166
msgid "There are a couple caveats to these actions that are useful:"
msgstr "这些动作有几个值得注意的注意事项："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:168
msgid ""
"The :term:`default version` isn't deleted even if it matches a rule. You can"
" use the ``Set version as default`` action to change the default version "
"before deleting the current one."
msgstr ""
":term:`default version` 不会被删除，即使它匹配某条规则。你可以使用 ``Set version as default`` "
"动作在删除当前默认版本前先更改默认版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:171
msgid ""
"If your versions follow :pep:`440`, Read the Docs activates and builds the "
"version if it's greater than the current stable version. The stable version "
"is also automatically updated at the same time. See more in :doc:`versions`."
msgstr ""
"如果你的版本遵循 :pep:`440` ，当版本大于当前稳定版本时，Read the Docs 会激活并构建它。稳定版本也会同时自动更新。更多详情见 "
":doc:`versions` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:177
msgid "Build actions"
msgstr "构建动作"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:179
msgid "Trigger build for version"
msgstr "触发版本构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:180
msgid "Trigger a build for the version when the rule matches."
msgstr "规则匹配时触发该版本的构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:182
msgid ""
"Build actions are designed to be used together with :ref:`webhook filters "
"<automation-rules:Webhook filters>`, so that builds are only triggered when "
"something relevant has changed."
msgstr ""
"构建动作旨在与 :ref:`Webhook 过滤器 <automation-rules:Webhook filters>` "
"配合使用，以便仅在发生相关变更时触发构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:187
msgid ""
"When a project has at least one enabled rule with the **Trigger build for "
"version** action, builds are **gated** by those rules: if no build rule "
"matches the incoming webhook event, no build is triggered. If you don't have"
" any build rule configured, builds keep being triggered for every push and "
"pull request as usual."
msgstr ""
"当项目至少有一条启用了**触发版本构建** 动作的规则时，构建会被这些规则** 控制** ：如果没有构建规则匹配传入的 Webhook "
"事件，则不会触发构建。如果未配置任何构建规则，构建将像往常一样为每次推送和 Pull Request 触发。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:193
msgid "Enabling and disabling rules"
msgstr "启用与禁用规则"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:195
msgid ""
"Each rule has an **Enabled** toggle. Disabling a rule keeps its "
"configuration around but stops it from being evaluated, which is useful when"
" you want to temporarily turn off an automation without losing its "
"configuration."
msgstr "每条规则都有一个**启用** 开关。禁用规则会保留其配置但停止评估，这在你想暂时关闭自动化但不想丢失配置时很有用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:200
msgid "Order"
msgstr "顺序"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:202
msgid ""
"When a new Read the Docs version is created, all rules with a successful "
"match will have their action triggered, in the order they appear on the "
":guilabel:`Automation Rules` page."
msgstr "创建新 Read the Docs 版本时，所有匹配成功的规则将按其在 :guilabel:`Automation Rules` 页面上的顺序触发动作。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:207
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:210
msgid "Activate all new tags"
msgstr "激活所有新标签"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:212
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:226
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:261
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:279
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:287
msgid "Match: ``Any version``"
msgstr "匹配：``Any version``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:213
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:234
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:255
msgid "Version type: ``Tag``"
msgstr "版本类型：``Tag``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:214
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:221
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:247
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:256
msgid "Action: ``Activate version``"
msgstr "动作：``Activate version``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:217
msgid "Activate only new branches that belong to the ``1.x`` release"
msgstr "仅激活属于 ``1.x`` 发布的新分支"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:219
msgid "Custom match: ``^1\\.\\d+$``"
msgstr "自定义匹配：``^1\\.\\d+$``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:220
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:227
msgid "Version type: ``Branch``"
msgstr "版本类型：``Branch``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:224
msgid "Delete an active version when a branch is deleted"
msgstr "分支删除时删除活跃版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:228
msgid "Action: ``Delete version``"
msgstr "动作：``Delete version``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:231
msgid "Set as default new tags that have the ``-stable`` or ``-release`` suffix"
msgstr "将带 ``-stable`` 或 ``-release`` 后缀的新标签设为默认"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:233
msgid "Custom match: ``-(stable|release)$``"
msgstr "自定义匹配：``-(stable|release)$``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:235
msgid "Action: ``Set version as default``"
msgstr "动作：``Set version as default``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:239
msgid ""
"You can also create two rules: one to match ``-stable`` and other to match "
"``-release``."
msgstr "你也可以创建两条规则：一条匹配 ``-stable`` ，另一条匹配 ``-release`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:243
msgid "Activate all new tags and branches that start with ``v`` or ``V``"
msgstr "激活所有以 ``v`` 或 ``V`` 开头的新标签和分支"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:245
msgid "Custom match: ``^[vV]``"
msgstr "自定义匹配：``^[vV]``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:246
msgid "Version types: ``Tag``, ``Branch``"
msgstr "版本类型：``Tag``, ``Branch``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:250
msgid "Activate all new tags that don't contain the ``-nightly`` suffix"
msgstr "激活所有不含 ``-nightly`` 后缀的新标签"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:254
msgid "Custom match: ``.*(?<!-nightly)$``"
msgstr "自定义匹配：``.*(?<!-nightly)$``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:259
msgid "Only build when documentation files change"
msgstr "仅在文档文件变更时构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:262
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:280
msgid "Version types: ``Tag``, ``Branch``, ``Pull request``"
msgstr "版本类型：``Tag``, ``Branch``, ``Pull request``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:263
msgid "Changed files:"
msgstr "变更的文件："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/automation-rules.rst:271
